You have a device # (SCSI ID)  conflict.. are your external drives on a
separate controller?

if not  you have 8 devices connected, you can only have 7 (SCSI ID 0-6) .

You have to have two partitions on the hard drive.

The entire drive -6mb as fat(32)  and 6mb as fat(16)

The boot and hal/pal code go in the 6mb partition (d:), The rest of the
stuff should install into the primary partition (C: ) similar to the NT
kits..

It's been a couple of years, I could look tomorrow in my notebook and let
you know for sure...



