Chris... I believe that SRM exists on your system, it must be enabled:

..On booting press F2 to enter Setup
..Choose CMOS SETUP
..F6 for Advanced
..Tab down to CONSOLE SELECTION
..Press the down arrow until Unix Console (SRM) is diplayed
..F10 to save changes

Hope this helps


