I've exactly the same machine running (with RH7.1). No extra
Why don't you start installing from SRM instead of ARC.
boot dka600 -fl root=dev/scd0 (where dkax00 is SCSI id of cdrom)
your system now stops in aboot
then choose install linux using predefined kernel in test mode (option 3
